<title>USA: IP Timberlands Ltd Q3 net slips.</title>
<headline>IP Timberlands Ltd Q3 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Unit			 $1.23		    $1.33</p>
<p> Net			 57,000		   58,000</p>
<p> Revs			83,000		   82,000</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Unit			 $7.87		    $3.96</p>
<p> Net			800,000		  172,000</p>
<p> Revs		     221,000		  237,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine month period includes $656 million gain.  </p>
<p>Gain is from the sale of partnership interests.</p>
<p>Units represent class A depository units.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 includes a $21 million bulk timber sale in the South. Approximately two-thirds of the earnings from this sale were attributed to class A units.</p>
</text>
